Subject: [PATCH] docs(patches): export the fork diff as a replayable patch
 series

Ship the 48 commits since the v0.22.5 base as `git am`-able patches so the
fork can be replayed onto a clean upstream checkout. Icon binaries are
stripped (single-file blob gate) and listed in assets-excluded.txt for a
one-command copy back.
